rate nature, though the text does not confirm his motivations or emotional state beyond the narrative frame.</div>\n                    \n\n                    \n                    \n                    <details style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem;\" id=\"evidence-1\">\n                        <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; color: var(--muted);\">📑 Source Evidence (7 citations)</summary>\n                        <div class=\"chapter-details\" style=\"margin-top: 0.5rem;\">\n                            <ul class=\"evidence-list\">\n                                \n                                \n                                <li class=\"evidence-item\" id=\"ev-1-1\">\n                                    <div>\n                                        <span class=\"tag\">fact</span>\n                                        \n                                    </div>\n                                    \n                                    <div style=\"margin-top: 0.25rem;\"><strong>The narrator is the storyteller of the event</strong></div>\n                                    \n                                    \n                                    \n                                </li>\n                                \n                                <li class=\"evidence-item\" id=\"ev-1-2\">\n                                    <div>\n                                        <span class=\"tag\">fact</span>\n                                        \n                                    </div>\n                                    \n                                    <div style=\"margin-top: 0.25rem;\"><strong>He fabricates a need to verify a wine purchase</strong></div>\n                                    \n                                    \n                                    \n                                </li>\n                                \n                                <li class=\"evidence-item\" id=\"ev-1-3\">\n                                 