\"character-profile character-item\" data-confidence=\"low\">\n                    <h4>\n                        Fortunato\n                        \n                        \n                        <span class=\"confidence-badge low\" title=\"Confidence: low\">\n                            ⚠\n                            \n                        </span>\n                    </h4>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                    \n\n                    \n\n                    \n\n                    \n                    \n\n                    \n                    \n                    <div class=\"profile-body\">Fortunato is a man whose pride and perceived arrogance lead to his downfall. He is portrayed as intoxicated, boastful, and oblivious to the danger he is in, ultimately becoming a victim of calculated manipulation and murder by Montresor. His confidence and self-assuredness mask his vulnerability, which Montresor exploits with chilling precision.</div>\n                    \n\n                    \n                    \n\n                    \n                    <details style=\"margin-top: 0.5rem;\">\n                        <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem;\">📊 Metadata</summary>\n                        <div class=\"profile-meta\" style=\"margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted);\">\n                            <span>14 mentions</span> •\n                            <span>First appears: Ch. 1</span> •","numLines":500,"startLine":500,"totalLines":2629}}}
